38279>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
38279>>>                Case Break
38280>>>
38280>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38280>>>
38280>>>        Case End
38280>>>
38280>>>        Send SetActionButtons
